{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28216","headline":"立春日 · 李远","name":"立春日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暖日傍帘晓，浓春开箧红。\n钗斜穿彩燕，罗薄翦春虫。\n巧着金刀力，寒侵玉指风。\n娉婷何处戴，山鬓绿成藂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}